# Company Investigator MCP - environment variables
#
# None of these are required for the server to start. `ping` and
# `buscar_empresa` never depend on them. Without them, the parts of
# `investigar_empresa` that need search/PEP/process confirmation simply
# return an empty result with an explanation, instead of failing.
#
# This project does not load .env files automatically (no python-dotenv).
# Export these as real environment variables in the shell that launches the
# server. See README.md "Configuration" for exact steps (including a WSL-
# specific gotcha with ~/.bashrc vs ~/.profile).

# Search discovery provider (Serper.dev - a Google Search results API).
# Free tier: 2,500 queries, no credit card. Get a key at https://serper.dev/api-key
SEARCH_PROVIDER=serper
SEARCH_API_KEY=

# Official judicial process confirmation by process number (DataJud / CNJ).
# Uses a public shared key published by the CNJ itself (not a personal
# registration) at https://datajud-wiki.cnj.jus.br/api-publica/acesso/
DATAJUD_API_KEY=

# Official Politically Exposed Persons registry (Portal da Transparencia / CGU).
# Free registration by email at
# https://www.portaldatransparencia.gov.br/api-de-dados/cadastrar-email
PORTAL_TRANSPARENCIA_API_KEY=
